# AIE1903 rules

- Mainline dataset: **cell_217**. Use **cell_30** only to dry-run the pipeline. `grid_273` only after mainline.
- Project root on school disk: `/ai/workspace/AIE1903` (volume `sun`). Persist only under `/ai/workspace`.
- No future leakage: never use test labels or features from future timestamps.
- Forecast horizon **289** steps; day cycle **288** (5-minute sampling).
- Official metrics (lower better): MAE, RMSE, MAPE, Masked MAPE@3e5, Masked MAPE@1e6.
- Validation plan: `configs/validation-plan.json`.
- Ignore NFS junk files named `.!!!*`. Do not wipe the whole disk.
- Never use research SSH host `10.27.126.205`.
- GitHub SSH key lives at `/ai/workspace/.ssh/id_ed25519_github` — ask user before adding to GitHub.
- After work: commit on disk; sync GitHub when allowed; release env only after save-image + disk sync.
